# (0.17.23) Every stored piece of every genre back to factory: Global, SEL + SAVE held on past the piece's own reset (1.5 s) to 6 s, stopped.
# A Reddit player: "Is there a 'restore ALL to factory settings' method?" Two pieces stored, in HYPNO and LOFI; playing it says STOP FIRST.
seed 0
wait 3000
# HYPNO piece 1 stored
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect saved 1
# LOFI piece 3 stored
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 1
turn PRESET 2
wait 200
tap ENV
spin K1 -10
wait 100
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect saved 4
# playing: the piece's reset happens, the rest says STOP FIRST
expect playing 1
tap HOME
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 200
expect view 33
press SEL
press SAVE
wait 6300
release SAVE
release SEL
wait 300
expect saved 0
press GLO
turn PRESET -1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 0
expect saved 1
# stopped: everything
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
tap HOME
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 200
expect view 33
press SEL
press SAVE
wait 6300
release SAVE
release SEL
wait 3000
expect genre 0
expect saved 0
press GLO
turn PRESET 1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 1
expect saved 0
# and after a power cycle
reboot
wait 500
expect saved 0
